(Sheldon:)I play my Endless Serpent,
Raj will play Ecstatic Frenzy...

4
00:00:15,322 --> 00:00:17,912
(Sheldon:)...which means Larry
will have to play Chaos Overlord.

5
00:00:18,075 --> 00:00:19,905
(Sheldon:)Then Captain Sweatpants,
Molten River.

6
