(Sheldon:)I play Nightshade Dryad.
Game, set and match.

7
00:00:27,251 --> 00:00:29,751
(Sheldon:)Now fetch me Wil Wheaton.

8
00:00:31,505 --> 00:00:36,095
[SPEAKING IN KLINGON]

9
00:00:37,427 --> 00:00:42,097
