best served cold," in Klingon?

10
00:00:42,266 --> 00:00:44,266
(Stuart:)I believe so.

11
00:00:44,434 --> 00:00:46,774
(Wil Wheaton:)What is wrong with him?

12
00:00:47,938 --> 00:00:50,438
(Stuart:)Everyone has a different theory.

13
00:00:55,445 --> 00:00:58,235
(Howard:)How about computers?
You like computers?

14
00:00:58,407 --> 00:01:01,077
(Bernadette:)I use them. I don't like them.

